note as DEP_diagram_04_directory
  TENANT IDENTITY RULE
  Hospital, diagnostic unit, pharmacy, insurer and broker identities are explicit
  extensions of tenants. A host-site relationship never merges tenants.

  Connects to other modules via:
  access_policies, geofences, insurance_claims, practices,
  provider_connections, roles, tenant_catalog_policies,
  tenant_concept_config, tenants_history, users
end note


